{"2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-cut-vinyl-decal-bui":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Cut Vinyl Decal Build and Apply | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"A real-world sign-shop infographic showing how cut vinyl, adhesive, liner, transfer tape, weeding, alignment, surface prep, pressure, and peel angle fit together.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-cut-vinyl-decal-bui/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Cut Vinyl Decal Build and Apply\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A real-world sign-shop infographic showing how cut vinyl, adhesive, liner, transfer tape, weeding, alignment, surface prep, pressure, and peel angle fit together.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-cut-vinyl-decal-bui.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-24\">2026-06-24</time>\n<h1>Cut Vinyl Decal Build and Apply</h1><p class=\"intro\">A real-world sign-shop infographic showing how cut vinyl, adhesive, liner, transfer tape, weeding, alignment, surface prep, pressure, and peel angle fit together.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-cut-vinyl-decal-bui.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-cut-vinyl-decal-bui.jpg\" alt=\"Cut Vinyl Decal Build and Apply\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-cut-vinyl-decal-bui.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>Application pressure helps seat the adhesive. Avery Dennison recommends squeegeeing the decal before removing the premask and again afterward, particularly around edges that could lift as the premask peels away. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://graphics.averydennison.com/content/dam/averydennison/graphics/na/en/documents/Instructional-Bulletins/Application-and-Removal-Information/ib400-application-instructions-ad-films.pdf\">Application Instructions for Avery Dennison Films</a> — Avery Dennison</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-thermal-recei":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Thermal Receipt Fades | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"A real-world materials-science infographic explaining how direct thermal receipt paper forms marks through heat-activated coating chemistry and why heat, UV, abrasion, oils, plasticizers, solvents, humidity, and poor storage can fade it.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-thermal-recei/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Thermal Receipt Fades\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A real-world materials-science infographic explaining how direct thermal receipt paper forms marks through heat-activated coating chemistry and why heat, UV, abrasion, oils, plasticizers, solvents, humidity, and poor storage can fade it.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-thermal-recei.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-24\">2026-06-24</time>\n<h1>How a Thermal Receipt Fades</h1><p class=\"intro\">A real-world materials-science infographic explaining how direct thermal receipt paper forms marks through heat-activated coating chemistry and why heat, UV, abrasion, oils, plasticizers, solvents, humidity, and poor storage can fade it.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-thermal-recei.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-thermal-recei.jpg\" alt=\"How a Thermal Receipt Fades\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-thermal-recei.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>A direct-thermal print can fade in sunlight or prolonged fluorescent light. The manufacturer also warns that plasticizers in some tapes and sleeves can fade the printed image, so the storage material matters as well as the light exposure. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://www.jujothermal.com/technical-guide/correct-storing/\">Correct storing</a> — Jujo Thermal</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-planted-aquarium-ni":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Planted Aquarium Nitrogen Cycle | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"A real-world aquarium-care infographic showing how waste becomes ammonia, nitrite, and nitrate, how nitrifying bacteria and plants interact, and why testing and water changes matter.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-planted-aquarium-ni/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Planted Aquarium Nitrogen Cycle\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A real-world aquarium-care infographic showing how waste becomes ammonia, nitrite, and nitrate, how nitrifying bacteria and plants interact, and why testing and water changes matter.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-planted-aquarium-ni.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-24\">2026-06-24</time>\n<h1>Planted Aquarium Nitrogen Cycle</h1><p class=\"intro\">A real-world aquarium-care infographic showing how waste becomes ammonia, nitrite, and nitrate, how nitrifying bacteria and plants interact, and why testing and water changes matter.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-planted-aquarium-ni.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-planted-aquarium-ni.jpg\" alt=\"Planted Aquarium Nitrogen Cycle\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-24-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-planted-aquarium-ni.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>Nitrification happens in two biological steps: ammonia is oxidized to nitrite, then nitrite is oxidized to nitrate. It requires oxygen; nitrate production does not mean nitrogen has left the aquarium. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://ask.ifas.ufl.edu/publication/FA031.pdf\">Ammonia in Aquatic Systems</a> — University of Florida IFAS Extension</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-mechanical-fi":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Mechanical Fire Sprinkler Head Works | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explains a common automatic fire sprinkler head with cutaway parts, heat-release concept, water path, deflector spray behavior, and conservative inspection-safe visual clues.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-mechanical-fi/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Mechanical Fire Sprinkler Head Works\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explains a common automatic fire sprinkler head with cutaway parts, heat-release concept, water path, deflector spray behavior, and conservative inspection-safe visual clues.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-mechanical-fi.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-25\">2026-06-25</time>\n<h1>How a Mechanical Fire Sprinkler Head Works</h1><p class=\"intro\">Explains a common automatic fire sprinkler head with cutaway parts, heat-release concept, water path, deflector spray behavior, and conservative inspection-safe visual clues.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-mechanical-fi.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-mechanical-fi.jpg\" alt=\"How a Mechanical Fire Sprinkler Head Works\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-mechanical-fi.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>The heat-responsive element holds an automatic sprinkler closed until heating causes it to break or release. A liquid-filled glass bulb is one design; other heads use a fusible metal link. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://www.bafsa.org.uk/assets/Downloads/BIF-8C-Sprinkler-Heads.pdf\">Sprinkler Heads</a> — British Automatic Fire Sprinkler Association</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-quartz-watch-":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Quartz Watch Keeps Time --slot factual-infographic | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"A conservative real-world horology/electronics infographic explaining how a quartz wristwatch turns a battery-powered crystal oscillator into hand movement.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-quartz-watch-/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Quartz Watch Keeps Time --slot factual-infographic\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A conservative real-world horology/electronics infographic explaining how a quartz wristwatch turns a battery-powered crystal oscillator into hand movement.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-quartz-watch-.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-25\">2026-06-25</time>\n<h1>How a Quartz Watch Keeps Time --slot factual-infographic</h1><p class=\"intro\">A conservative real-world horology/electronics infographic explaining how a quartz wristwatch turns a battery-powered crystal oscillator into hand movement.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-quartz-watch-.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-quartz-watch-.jpg\" alt=\"How a Quartz Watch Keeps Time --slot factual-infographic\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-25-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-quartz-watch-.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>A quartz oscillator provides a precise timing frequency. The first Seiko Quartz Astron used 8,192 Hz; 32,768 Hz became standard in later quartz timepieces, so not every early quartz watch used the same frequency. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://museum.seiko.co.jp/en/knowledge/Quartz01/\">Quartz Timepieces</a> — The Seiko Museum Ginza</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-26-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-honeybee-wagg":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Honeybee Waggle Dance Shares a Food Location | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explains how a worker honeybee&#x27;s waggle run, return loops, dance angle, and waggle duration/vigor communicate food direction and general distance to nestmates.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-26-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-honeybee-wagg/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Honeybee Waggle Dance Shares a Food Location\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explains how a worker honeybee&#x27;s waggle run, return loops, dance angle, and waggle duration/vigor communicate food direction and general distance to nestmates.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-26-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-honeybee-wagg.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-26\">2026-06-26</time>\n<h1>How a Honeybee Waggle Dance Shares a Food Location</h1><p class=\"intro\">Explains how a worker honeybee&#x27;s waggle run, return loops, dance angle, and waggle duration/vigor communicate food direction and general distance to nestmates.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-26-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-honeybee-wagg.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-26-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-honeybee-wagg.jpg\" alt=\"How a Honeybee Waggle Dance Shares a Food Location\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-26-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-honeybee-wagg.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>In the waggle dance, the orientation of the waggle run encodes direction relative to the sun, while the duration of the waggle run conveys distance. Returning foragers use the dance to recruit nestmates to a resource. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://content.ces.ncsu.edu/honey-bee-dance-language\">The Honey Bee Dance Language</a> — NC State Extension</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-27-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-bicycle-freeh":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Bicycle Freehub Body Engages and Coasts | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explains how a bicycle freehub body engages under pedaling load and clicks while coasting, with core parts and maintenance observations.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-27-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-bicycle-freeh/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Bicycle Freehub Body Engages and Coasts\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explains how a bicycle freehub body engages under pedaling load and clicks while coasting, with core parts and maintenance observations.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-27-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-bicycle-freeh.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-27\">2026-06-27</time>\n<h1>How a Bicycle Freehub Body Engages and Coasts</h1><p class=\"intro\">Explains how a bicycle freehub body engages under pedaling load and clicks while coasting, with core parts and maintenance observations.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-27-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-bicycle-freeh.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-27-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-bicycle-freeh.jpg\" alt=\"How a Bicycle Freehub Body Engages and Coasts\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-27-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-bicycle-freeh.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>A typical pawl-and-ratchet freehub lets the wheel turn independently of the cassette while coasting. When you pedal, the pawls engage the ratchet teeth so the cassette can drive the hub. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://www.parktool.com/en-us/blog/repair-help/freehub-service\">Freehub Service</a> — Park Tool</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-28-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-refrigerator-":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Refrigerator Door Seal Works | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Shows how a flexible magnetic refrigerator door gasket compresses against the cabinet, limits warm-air leaks, and can develop condensation risk when dirty, twisted, or poorly seated.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-28-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-refrigerator-/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Refrigerator Door Seal Works\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Shows how a flexible magnetic refrigerator door gasket compresses against the cabinet, limits warm-air leaks, and can develop condensation risk when dirty, twisted, or poorly seated.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-28-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-refrigerator-.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-28\">2026-06-28</time>\n<h1>How a Refrigerator Door Seal Works</h1><p class=\"intro\">Shows how a flexible magnetic refrigerator door gasket compresses against the cabinet, limits warm-air leaks, and can develop condensation risk when dirty, twisted, or poorly seated.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-28-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-refrigerator-.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-28-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-refrigerator-.jpg\" alt=\"How a Refrigerator Door Seal Works\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-28-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-refrigerator-.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>Magnetic refrigerator seals can use an extruded magnetic strip shaped for the door gasket. The strip is part of the seal; the gasket is the material that closes the gap around the door. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://www.higamaterials.com/products/extruded-door-seal-magnetic-strip\">Extruded Door Seal Magnetic Strip</a> — HIGA Magnetic Materials</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-29-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-manual-can-op":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Manual Can Opener Works | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"A conservative non-fiction engineering infographic explaining how a handheld rotary can opener clamps, feeds, and cuts around a can lid.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-29-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-manual-can-op/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Manual Can Opener Works\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A conservative non-fiction engineering infographic explaining how a handheld rotary can opener clamps, feeds, and cuts around a can lid.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-29-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-manual-can-op.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-29\">2026-06-29</time>\n<h1>How a Manual Can Opener Works</h1><p class=\"intro\">A conservative non-fiction engineering infographic explaining how a handheld rotary can opener clamps, feeds, and cuts around a can lid.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-29-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-manual-can-op.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-29-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-manual-can-op.jpg\" alt=\"How a Manual Can Opener Works\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-29-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-manual-can-op.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>In this rotary design, the can rim guides the opener while the cutting wheel moves along the inside edge. The wheels keep the opener positioned so the cutter can make a continuous cut around the top. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US1838525A/en\">US1838525A: Can opener</a> — U.S. Patent Office</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n","2026-06-30-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-zipper-slider":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>How a Zipper Slider Interlocks Teeth | Jez237 Factual Infographics</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explains how a real zipper slider guides separated teeth into an interlocked chain, with conservative engineering labels and repair-bench context.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://jez237.com/experiments/image-gen-2-benchmark/infographics/2026-06-30-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-zipper-slider/\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How a Zipper Slider Interlocks Teeth\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explains how a real zipper slider guides separated teeth into an interlocked chain, with conservative engineering labels and repair-bench context.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-30-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-zipper-slider.jpg\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../infographic-article.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"../../factual-infographics\">Factual Infographics</a> / Factual Infographics</nav></header>\n<main><article>\n<header><time datetime=\"2026-06-30\">2026-06-30</time>\n<h1>How a Zipper Slider Interlocks Teeth</h1><p class=\"intro\">Explains how a real zipper slider guides separated teeth into an interlocked chain, with conservative engineering labels and repair-bench context.</p></header>\n<figure><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-30-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-zipper-slider.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-30-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-zipper-slider.jpg\" alt=\"How a Zipper Slider Interlocks Teeth\"></a>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://media.jez237.com/image-gen-2-benchmark/images/2026-06-30-factual-infographic-factual-infographic-how-a-zipper-slider.jpg\">View full-size infographic</a></figcaption></figure>\n<section><h2>Research added after publication</h2><ul><li>A zipper has two rows of matching elements, a slider and fabric tapes. Moving the slider brings the elements together so they mesh; reversing it separates the rows. <a href=\"#source-1\">[1]</a></li></ul><h3>Sources</h3><ol><li id=\"source-1\"><a href=\"https://www.ykk.com/english/ykk/tech/01.html\">The Structure of a Zipper</a> — YKK</li></ol></section>\n</article></main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}
